  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poultry Farming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partners want to establish a poultry facility. The aim is to supply the Afghan population with high quality and healthy poultry meat. The business will cover all activities of the poultry production chain: breeding, hatchery, butchery, marketing, distribution, and raising breeders. The end products are fresh meat and deep frozen chicken. Production will be performed according to approved European standards (T&#xdc;V and DEKRA) under strict observance of hygiene and animal health. The butchery will be performed in accordance with Islam rules.The investment will create 125 new jobs. 50% of these jobs are allocated to women.The applicant has experience in establishing poultry facilities in difficult countries e.g. Belarus, Turkmenistan and Uzbekistan. The applicant will be responsible for the setting up the facility and installing the machinery and equipment. Local partner was established in 2007 for this project. The owner of this company will be responsible for the daily management, marketing and distribution.</narrative>
  </description>
